  "description": "Hela is cursed to lose her magic if she doesn't engage in a sexual relationship. As she feels her magical powers gradually wane, she decides to move to a quiet village. There, she encounters a young man named Calvin, who has nowhere else to go, and they decide to live together.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/solvecurse), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/solvecurse), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000068371), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12271564) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_3468)",
